  max / median error: 7.379e-08 / 1.139e-08
  relative error max/median: 9.733e-08 / 2.725e-08
  float32 machine epsilon  : 1.192e-07  -> the largest relative error is 0.82x eps32, and 0/147 cases exceed 2x eps32
