  H_k constant across the 10 rounds and 4 methods: max within-client span = 0.000e+00 over 150 clients, so this guard covers all 6000 telemetry rows
Basis cross-check : max |CV(train split) - CV(full partition)| = 5.245e-03; Spearman between bases = 0.999846 (excluding the 3 M2 clients, whose single sample falls entirely into the validation split, giving CV=1 on one basis and the sentinel 0 on the other)
